  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Now let's perform an update cycle of the board symbol, which should be immediately reflected in our array renderer above.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Now let's perform an update cycle of the board symbol, which should be immediately reflected in our array renderer above.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Do[
  board = CellularAutomaton["GameOfLife", board];
  Pause[0.1];
, {i, 1, 100}]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
All instances update live! Even if you copy and paste the same expression, its display will be unique and will still be properly updated.

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
All instances update live! Even if you copy and paste the same expression, its display will be unique and will still be properly updated.

